1
00:00:01,042 --> 00:00:02,419
I'm so sorry.

2
00:00:02,419 --> 00:00:04,921
I guess I pushed you too hard.

3
00:00:04,921 --> 00:00:06,297
No... it's my fault.

4
00:00:06,297 --> 00:00:08,633
I overdid it.

5
00:00:08,633 --> 00:00:11,636
Let's not tell Ji-sung.

6
00:00:12,303 --> 00:00:15,306
It'll just make him
worried for no reason.

7
00:00:26,317 --> 00:00:27,235
Ji-sung

8
00:00:27,235 --> 00:00:29,821
haven't seen
Seung-hyun in days.

9
00:00:29,821 --> 00:00:32,824
I can't reach him either...
Something's wrong.

10
00:00:35,035 --> 00:00:36,536
Maybe you should
check on him at home.

11
00:00:37,579 --> 00:00:40,582
Yeah, I will.

12
00:00:43,043 --> 00:00:45,628
Seung‑hyun, it's me.

13
00:00:45,628 --> 00:00:47,464
Are you okay?

14
00:00:53,094 --> 00:00:55,305
Ji-sung...

15
00:00:55,305 --> 00:00:57,098
I'm not feeling well.

16
00:00:57,098 --> 00:01:00,060
What's wrong? Open the door.

17
00:01:00,060 --> 00:01:02,187
No, it's nothing.

18
00:01:02,187 --> 00:01:04,647
It's just a cold.

19
00:01:04,647 --> 00:01:06,232
I don't want you to catch it.

20
00:01:06,232 --> 00:01:08,276
You sure you're alright?

21
00:01:09,177 --> 00:01:10,257
Yes.

22
00:01:25,001 --> 00:01:28,004
Yeah...

23
00:01:28,004 --> 00:01:31,800
I guess this is where
I draw the line.
